1
00:01:48,149 --> 00:01:50,359
Hei, jangan terus jalan saja.

2
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,361
Nanti awak sesat lagi.

3
00:01:52,362 --> 00:01:54,823
Macam mana saya nak sesat
sedangkan saya boleh tengok dengan jelas?

4
00:01:55,323 --> 00:01:57,199
Yalah.

5
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,910
Awak rasa apa yang jadi pada benda itu?

6
00:01:59,911 --> 00:02:02,162
Singa yang jadi kucing itu?

7
00:02:02,163 --> 00:02:05,332
Tidak, saya rasa kucing yang
bertukar jadi singa.

8
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:06,917
Asalnya ia seekor kucing!

9
00:02:06,918 --> 00:02:08,001
Bukan, singalah!

10
00:02:08,002 --> 00:02:08,919
Bukan, kucinglah!

11
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,379
- Singa!
- Kucing!

12
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:12,881
Peduli apa?

13
00:02:12,882 --> 00:02:15,008
Semua benda di sini besar.

14
00:02:15,009 --> 00:02:16,719
Ada nampak arnab berdekatan?

15
00:02:18,972 --> 00:02:20,472
Ada sesuatu datang.

16
00:02:20,473 --> 00:02:21,807
Apa? Benda apa?

17
00:02:21,808 --> 00:02:23,810
Nami! Tunggu belakang saya!

18
00:02:27,647 --> 00:02:28,773
Apa?

19
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:40,994
Apa benda itu?

20
00:02:47,792 --> 00:02:52,046
<i>"Misi di Negara Misteri!
Rahsia Dewa Matahari"</i>

21
00:03:11,107 --> 00:03:12,775
Hei.

22
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:18,489
Wah! Hebatnya!

23
00:03:21,743 --> 00:03:23,160
Tak mahu serangga!

24
00:03:23,161 --> 00:03:25,120
Saya tak suka serangga besar!

25
00:03:25,121 --> 00:03:26,955
Itu belalang!

26
00:03:26,956 --> 00:03:28,333
Macam mana ia berfungsi?

27
00:03:28,917 --> 00:03:31,627
Kamu orang baharu di sini?

28
00:03:31,628 --> 00:03:33,170
Siapa awak, orang tua?

29
00:03:33,171 --> 00:03:34,129
Kami di mana?

30
00:03:34,130 --> 00:03:35,631
Awak ada nampak kru kami?

31
00:03:35,632 --> 00:03:37,090
Boleh saya cuba tunggang?

32
00:03:37,091 --> 00:03:38,008
- Kru?
- Berapa harganya?

33
00:03:38,009 --> 00:03:40,093
Banyak sangat soalan!

34
00:03:40,094 --> 00:03:41,971
Tempat apa ini?

35
00:03:43,932 --> 00:03:47,685
Maaf, saya nak kejar masa,
jadi saya tak ada masa nak berbual,

36
00:03:48,311 --> 00:03:53,232
tapi semua tanah terbentang luas ini
milik Dewa Matahari.

37
00:03:53,233 --> 00:03:54,691
Dewa Matahari?

38
00:03:54,692 --> 00:03:55,943
Dewa?

39
00:03:55,944 --> 00:03:57,319
Ya betul.

40
00:03:57,320 --> 00:04:00,781
Dewa Matahari yang cipta negara ini

41
00:04:00,782 --> 00:04:04,785
dan memerintah segalanya
yang berlaku di sini.

42
00:04:04,786 --> 00:04:07,371
Wah! Adakah dia kuat?

43
00:04:07,372 --> 00:04:09,623
Mestilah! Dia seorang Dewa!

44
00:04:09,624 --> 00:04:12,834
Itu Yggdrasil, Pokok Dunia.

45
00:04:12,835 --> 00:04:17,089
Dewa Matahari cipta negara ini
dengan Yggdrasil sebagai jantungnya

46
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:19,759
dan menghantar pelbagai dewa.

47
00:04:20,343 --> 00:04:22,637
Orang gelar tempat ini Tanah Para Dewa.

48
00:04:23,346 --> 00:04:27,432
Semua orang di negara ini
memandang tinggi dan hormat para dewa.

49
00:04:27,433 --> 00:04:28,976
Begitu.

50
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:32,729
Jika itu kepercayaan tempat ini,
kita perlu hormatinya.

51
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:35,357
Kita patut ikut adat tempatan.

52
00:04:35,358 --> 00:04:40,821
Saya berkhidmat pada pemerintah
Istana Bigstein dan salah seorang dewa,

53
00:04:40,822 --> 00:04:43,032
Tuan Iscat!

54
00:04:43,866 --> 00:04:48,328
Jika awak mahu, mungkin satu hari
awak dibenarkan menghadap dia.

55
00:04:48,329 --> 00:04:51,164
Apa? Ada orang di istana itu?

56
00:04:51,165 --> 00:04:52,666
Tidak, ia seekor kucing.

57
00:04:52,667 --> 00:04:54,043
Kucing?

58
00:04:57,797 --> 00:04:59,966
Maaf, kucing itu baru...

59
00:05:02,302 --> 00:05:04,720
Baiklah, saya minta diri dulu.

60
00:05:04,721 --> 00:05:08,683
Dewa Jarum si landak
sedang lapar sekarang.

61
00:05:09,475 --> 00:05:10,643
Landak?

62
00:05:15,148 --> 00:05:20,319
Dewa Telinga si arnab gergasi terkorban
dalam kebakaran pekan berdekatan,

63
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,487
dan ia telah melengahkan saya sedikit.

64
00:05:22,488 --> 00:05:24,782
Kita di...

65
00:05:26,034 --> 00:05:28,661
Dahsyat betul tragedi itu.

66
00:05:30,496 --> 00:05:35,375
Jika kamu lapar, kamu patut
pergi ke pekan dan beli dedak.

67
00:05:35,376 --> 00:05:36,710
Dedak?

68
00:05:36,711 --> 00:05:38,629
Itu maksudnya makanan.

69
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:45,553
Sebagai berjaga-jaga, saya nak beritahu...

70
00:05:46,471 --> 00:05:50,515
Jangan sesekali kamu pergi
ke sebalik istana itu.

71
00:05:50,516 --> 00:05:51,768
Apa? Kenapa?

72
00:05:52,351 --> 00:05:54,604
Di situ ada kuil Dewa Matahari,

73
00:05:55,104 --> 00:05:57,814
yang dikawal askar yang ganas.

74
00:05:57,815 --> 00:06:01,819
Tiada siapa yang mendekatinya
pulang dengan selamat.

75
00:06:03,571 --> 00:06:05,073
Kejap, jangan cakap begitu!

76
00:06:11,370 --> 00:06:13,956
Patah balik!

77
00:06:16,125 --> 00:06:17,084
Si bodoh itu...

78
00:06:17,085 --> 00:06:19,087
Baiklah, pak cik,
terima kasih atas segalanya!

79
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:21,631
Oh ya, dan...

80
00:06:22,298 --> 00:06:24,300
maaf atas segalanya.

81
00:06:25,885 --> 00:06:28,638
Aduhai, Luffy...

82
00:06:29,555 --> 00:06:31,640
Askar yang ganas, ya?

83
00:06:31,641 --> 00:06:34,851
Luffy jadi begitu sebab awak pun begitu!

84
00:06:34,852 --> 00:06:35,812
Awak patut malu!

85
00:06:36,395 --> 00:06:38,356
Siapa mereka?

86
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:44,487
Apa? Istana itu runtuh?

87
00:06:49,534 --> 00:06:51,410
Saya dapat bau pengembaraan!

88
00:06:51,994 --> 00:06:53,703
Askar kejam?

89
00:06:53,704 --> 00:06:55,372
Dewa?

90
00:06:55,373 --> 00:06:58,542
Tunjukkan diri kamu!

91
00:06:58,543 --> 00:06:59,709
Situ pun dia!

92
00:06:59,710 --> 00:07:03,213
Tunggu, Luffy! Fikirkan Nami!

93
00:07:03,214 --> 00:07:04,840
Tak ada gunanya, Sanji.

94
00:07:04,841 --> 00:07:07,384
Tiada siapa boleh halang Luffy
bila dia bersemangat.

95
00:07:07,385 --> 00:07:09,177
Besar betul tempat ini.

96
00:07:09,178 --> 00:07:11,722
Tak ada rumah di sekeliling ini.

97
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:16,101
Jalan ini tak habis-habis?

98
00:07:16,102 --> 00:07:17,894
Tengoklah istana itu.

99
00:07:17,895 --> 00:07:21,189
Bukankah bentuknya sama
dengan istana kita lihat tadi?

100
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:22,567
Oh?

101
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:28,865
Ada orang lari ke sini.

102
00:07:29,407 --> 00:07:31,534
Dia pakai pakaian Elbaf juga.

103
00:07:32,535 --> 00:07:34,996
Peduli apa. Mari elak dia dan teruskan.

104
00:07:40,877 --> 00:07:42,586
Apa yang dia buat?

105
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:45,046
Hei, jaga-jaga semua!

106
00:07:45,047 --> 00:07:47,341
Ke tepilah!

107
00:07:50,803 --> 00:07:52,095
Apa?

108
00:07:52,096 --> 00:07:54,891
Langit retak?

109
00:07:58,394 --> 00:07:59,603
Apa?

110
00:07:59,604 --> 00:08:02,190
Macam mana ini berlaku?

111
00:08:05,359 --> 00:08:08,945
Tengok! Langit di atas kuil itu retak!

112
00:08:08,946 --> 00:08:11,657
Sekejap, di belakang pun sama!

113
00:08:12,241 --> 00:08:13,742
Apa yang berlaku?

114
00:08:13,743 --> 00:08:16,245
Banyak perkara berlaku
di negara ini hari ini!

115
00:08:26,172 --> 00:08:27,507
Langit...

116
00:08:28,007 --> 00:08:29,509
dah pecah...

117
00:08:31,093 --> 00:08:34,513
Saya pasti! Ini satu sumpahan!
Satu hukuman suci!

118
00:08:34,514 --> 00:08:38,099
Landak dan kucing kita belasah tadi itu
adalah dewa, bukan?

119
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:40,519
Kita telah berdepan kemarahan mereka.

120
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,395
Tengok baik-baik.

121
00:08:57,370 --> 00:08:58,955
Apa?

122
00:09:03,543 --> 00:09:05,043
Sekejap, jadi...

123
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:06,963
Apa maksud ini?

124
00:09:12,927 --> 00:09:15,720
Jelas sekali ini rumah untuk gergasi.

125
00:09:15,721 --> 00:09:19,015
Tak mungkin ini dalam kapal Elbaf, bukan?

126
00:09:19,016 --> 00:09:21,393
Ya, saya tak nampak bilik begini.

127
00:09:21,394 --> 00:09:24,854
Lagipun, pagar besi apa ini?

128
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:27,400
Jika ada gergasi di seberang,

129
00:09:28,818 --> 00:09:33,864
kita seperti haiwan peliharaan
yang dibela dalam sangkar besar.

130
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:35,825
Tak mungkin...

131
00:09:50,256 --> 00:09:52,299
Hei!

132
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:53,801
Bunyi bising apa itu?

133
00:09:55,386 --> 00:09:57,221
Ada orang di sana?

134
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,766
Tolong saya!

135
00:10:40,181 --> 00:10:42,223
Aduhai tinggi betul!

136
00:10:42,224 --> 00:10:43,517
Lompat.

137
00:10:44,018 --> 00:10:46,603
Hei! Awak di mana?

138
00:10:46,604 --> 00:10:48,272
Hei!

139
00:10:50,066 --> 00:10:52,109
Di sini.

140
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:01,451
Chopper!

141
00:11:01,452 --> 00:11:05,289
Semua! Gembira dapat jumpa kamu lagi!

142
00:11:08,250 --> 00:11:10,002
Kenapa dengan rantai itu?

143
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:15,632
Saya tak tahu! Ia sudah ada
waktu saya terjaga di sini!

144
00:11:15,633 --> 00:11:19,095
Saya tak dapat buka sebab besi rantai ini
begitu keras!

145
00:11:19,595 --> 00:11:22,722
Saya ingat saya akan mati!

146
00:11:22,723 --> 00:11:23,891
Jangan bergerak.

147
00:11:25,101 --> 00:11:26,309
Biar saya potong.

148
00:11:26,310 --> 00:11:27,311
Awak menakutkan saya!

149
00:11:28,312 --> 00:11:30,064
Kunci seperti ini

150
00:11:31,232 --> 00:11:32,732
mudah saja!

151
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:35,027
Wah! Memang layaklah awak digelar
Pencuri Kucing!

152
00:11:39,949 --> 00:11:42,033
Terima kasih, Nami!

153
00:11:42,034 --> 00:11:44,244
Kasihan Chopper.

154
00:11:44,245 --> 00:11:45,954
Awak selamat sekarang.

155
00:11:45,955 --> 00:11:47,414
Awak dah berhutang dengan saya.

156
00:11:47,415 --> 00:11:48,331
Apa?

157
00:11:48,332 --> 00:11:50,417
Awak pun menangis tadi!

158
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:51,544
Itu berbeza.

159
00:11:54,588 --> 00:11:56,215
Ini bilik gergasi.

160
00:11:56,966 --> 00:11:58,926
Ada pakaian bersaiz manusia.

161
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:01,970
{\an8}Kita sedang dilayan seperti anak patung?

162
00:12:01,971 --> 00:12:05,682
Tapi, bila difikirkan gergasi
yang buat ini...

163
00:12:05,683 --> 00:12:06,641
Ia buat kita tertanya-tanya

164
00:12:06,642 --> 00:12:09,770
jika Dewa Matahari begitu
teliti dan mahir dengan tangannya.

165
00:12:19,405 --> 00:12:21,198
Awak buat apa itu?

166
00:12:23,033 --> 00:12:24,826
Tengok sini, Sanji!

167
00:12:24,827 --> 00:12:26,745
Ada banyak blok mainan!

168
00:12:28,497 --> 00:12:29,831
Memanglah.

169
00:12:29,832 --> 00:12:31,709
Seluruh tempat ini diperbuat
daripada blok itu.

170
00:12:32,418 --> 00:12:34,836
Bila awak gril arnab itu,
baunya sangat busuk

171
00:12:34,837 --> 00:12:37,797
disebabkan resin sintetik yang terbakar.

172
00:12:37,798 --> 00:12:40,676
Langit awak langgar itu pula...

173
00:12:41,552 --> 00:12:44,096
Ia nampak seperti jalan tak berpenghujung.

174
00:12:45,097 --> 00:12:46,764
Ia disebabkan itu cuma cermin.

175
00:12:46,765 --> 00:12:48,016
Cermin?

176
00:12:48,017 --> 00:12:51,269
<i>Jadi, orang itu adalah saya?</i>

177
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,396
Ya.

178
00:12:52,897 --> 00:12:53,731
Tengoklah.

179
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:59,611
Saya boleh lihat melepasinya!

180
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:02,364
Nampaknya ia cuma sekeping kaca
daripada sisi sini.

181
00:13:02,865 --> 00:13:05,910
Saya tak tahu jika cermin ajaib
seperti itu wujud...

182
00:13:09,163 --> 00:13:10,164
Nami.

183
00:13:10,789 --> 00:13:13,416
Boleh saya kemas bilik perempuan...

184
00:13:13,417 --> 00:13:15,085
Jangan fikir nak memasangnya!

185
00:13:15,711 --> 00:13:20,048
Jadi, ada gergasi aneh yang bina
Negara Blok,

186
00:13:20,049 --> 00:13:23,635
lempar manusia dan haiwan ke dalamnya
hanya untuk berseronok?

187
00:13:23,636 --> 00:13:25,261
Aneh betul.

188
00:13:25,262 --> 00:13:28,264
Tapi, itu bermaksud kita sudah
sampai ke Elbaf?

189
00:13:28,265 --> 00:13:31,060
Ini ialah rumah Gergasi
di Negara Gergasi?

190
00:13:34,271 --> 00:13:35,898
Saya dah agak!

191
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:39,360
Kita berjaya!

192
00:13:41,445 --> 00:13:43,030
Tak juga.

193
00:13:43,656 --> 00:13:47,742
Satu perkara yang pasti
adalah ini bilik Gergasi.

194
00:13:47,743 --> 00:13:49,744
Kita perlu keluar untuk siasat.

195
00:13:49,745 --> 00:13:51,371
Mana yang lain?

196
00:13:51,372 --> 00:13:53,540
Mari kita keluar sebelum
Gergasi itu pulang!

197
00:13:53,541 --> 00:13:57,086
Saya rasa lebih baik kita balik ke pekan
dan kumpul maklumat.

198
00:13:59,046 --> 00:14:01,422
Apa-apa pun, tak kisahlah
sepelik mana Gergasi ini,

199
00:14:01,423 --> 00:14:03,551
elak cari masalah dengan mereka.

200
00:14:04,051 --> 00:14:05,802
Luffy, awak faham tak?

201
00:14:05,803 --> 00:14:08,013
Berhenti buat masalah...

202
00:14:10,558 --> 00:14:12,726
Boleh saya belasah yang ini?

203
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,939
Ya, belasah saja!

204
00:14:19,817 --> 00:14:20,733
Tengok bawah!

205
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:22,235
TIkus!

206
00:14:22,236 --> 00:14:23,153
Apa?

207
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:25,738
Apa?

208
00:14:25,739 --> 00:14:28,367
Tidak! Ia boleh memanjat!

209
00:14:31,704 --> 00:14:33,038
Ada gagak juga!

210
00:14:34,582 --> 00:14:36,250
Ia dah sampai!

211
00:14:37,084 --> 00:14:40,461
Adakah mereka askar kuil ini?

212
00:14:40,462 --> 00:14:43,548
Jadi, inilah sebabnya tiada siapa
pulang hidup-hidup.

213
00:14:43,549 --> 00:14:47,135
Macam mana tempat ini
boleh jadi kuil pula?

214
00:14:47,136 --> 00:14:49,305
Awak sudah makan arnab!

215
00:14:49,889 --> 00:14:52,057
Jadi, belasah semua haiwan!

216
00:15:20,127 --> 00:15:21,711
Kalahkan dengan satu serangan!

217
00:15:21,712 --> 00:15:24,048
Jika Dewa Matahari pulang...

218
00:15:26,675 --> 00:15:29,011
Baiklah, mari lakukannya!

219
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:46,904
Gear Lima...

220
00:16:39,248 --> 00:16:41,375
Tunggu, tikus tak guna.

221
00:16:55,973 --> 00:16:57,641
Saya cakap

222
00:16:58,434 --> 00:16:59,893
tunggu!

223
00:17:12,406 --> 00:17:14,867
Chopper! Boleh kita naik ke atas?

224
00:17:16,744 --> 00:17:19,371
Baiklah! Ada apa-apa di sana?

225
00:17:20,831 --> 00:17:22,332
Saya terbau harta karun!

226
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:41,435
Apa?

227
00:17:49,610 --> 00:17:51,819
Panasnya! Siapa buat ini?

228
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,738
Luffy! Awak melampau sangat!

229
00:17:53,739 --> 00:17:56,825
Saya tak sebarkan api dari pendiangan!

230
00:18:08,337 --> 00:18:10,547
Apa?

231
00:18:12,925 --> 00:18:14,259
Itu Dewa Matahari?

232
00:18:17,304 --> 00:18:21,183
Kuil saya...

233
00:18:22,351 --> 00:18:23,601
Hei, Luffy!

234
00:18:23,602 --> 00:18:26,062
Dewa Matahari sudah pulang!

235
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:27,356
Mari kita pergi!

236
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,024
Baiklah!

237
00:18:29,608 --> 00:18:30,818
Pergi dulu!

238
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:39,076
Saya nak habiskan ini juga.

239
00:18:47,835 --> 00:18:49,378
Muginn!

240
00:18:54,383 --> 00:18:56,802
Kuasa Getah...

241
00:18:57,636 --> 00:18:59,304
Pistol

242
00:18:59,805 --> 00:19:02,182
Putih!

243
00:19:09,022 --> 00:19:10,566
Hilmungardr!

244
00:19:11,150 --> 00:19:12,317
Kita perlu pergi!

245
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,694
Ini...

246
00:19:14,695 --> 00:19:15,862
Mari, Nami!

247
00:19:15,863 --> 00:19:16,697
Baiklah!

248
00:19:21,326 --> 00:19:22,660
Usopp!

249
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:23,579
Ya!

250
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:25,330
Cepat, Luffy!

251
00:19:38,051 --> 00:19:40,012
Tak dapat dimaafkan!

252
00:19:40,929 --> 00:19:42,889
Gergasi itu agak besar!

253
00:19:42,890 --> 00:19:45,350
Ya, ia nampak menakutkan.

254
00:19:46,643 --> 00:19:47,769
Tengok.

255
00:20:10,834 --> 00:20:11,918
Apa ia kata?

256
00:20:11,919 --> 00:20:14,086
Dia cakap, "Saya tak akan lupakan ini!"

257
00:20:14,087 --> 00:20:15,129
Okey.

258
00:20:15,130 --> 00:20:16,714
Apa pun, tengok ini!

259
00:20:16,715 --> 00:20:18,967
Saya tak jumpa apa-apa bernilai, tapi...

260
00:20:20,219 --> 00:20:22,720
Ini pelan Negara Blok.

261
00:20:22,721 --> 00:20:24,513
Jadi, ia peta?

262
00:20:24,514 --> 00:20:25,891
Betul.

263
00:20:26,475 --> 00:20:27,683
Bagus, Nami!

264
00:20:27,684 --> 00:20:29,727
Macam itulah Nami saya!

265
00:20:29,728 --> 00:20:30,562
Dia dah sampai!

266
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:41,198
Berani betul awak...

267
00:20:41,782 --> 00:20:45,160
Berani awak hancurkan negara saya?

268
00:20:46,286 --> 00:20:48,121
Semua, sedia!

269
00:20:48,705 --> 00:20:52,041
Lintas kawasan gersang,
melepasi istana, jalan terus.

270
00:20:52,042 --> 00:20:53,918
Kemudian kita akan langgar
satu lagi cermin!

271
00:20:53,919 --> 00:20:56,379
Jika kita hancurkannya
dan seluruh dinding,

272
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:57,839
kita akan boleh keluar!

273
00:21:01,551 --> 00:21:03,220
Baiklah, semua!

274
00:21:04,763 --> 00:21:06,682
Mari pergi dari sini!

275
00:21:09,977 --> 00:21:12,354
Tanah bergegar!

276
00:21:13,438 --> 00:21:15,731
Dewa Matahari

277
00:21:15,732 --> 00:21:17,317
sedang marah!

278
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:24,116
Saya tak akan benarkan kamu lari!

279
00:21:24,616 --> 00:21:30,539
{\an8}BERSAMBUNG

280
00:23:05,550 --> 00:23:08,803
<i>Aksi kejar mengejar terhebat
berlangsung di Negara Blok.</i>

281
00:23:08,804 --> 00:23:14,225
<i>Dewa Matahari memburu Luffy dan yang lain,
namun, apakah identiti sebenarnya?</i>

282
00:23:14,226 --> 00:23:16,519
<i>Sewaktu pertempuran semakin panas,</i>

283
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:21,232
<i>satu serangan daripada Luffy membentuk
haluan ke satu pengembaraan baharu.</i>

284
00:23:21,233 --> 00:23:22,525
<i>Episode seterusnya dalam</i> ONE PIECE!

285
00:23:22,526 --> 00:23:26,028
<i>"Musnahkan Taman Mini
Melarikan Diri Dari Negara Blok!"</i>

286
00:23:26,029 --> 00:23:28,323
<i>Saya akan jadi Raja Lanun!</i>

287
00:23:30,742 --> 00:23:36,623
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Fikri D. Dali

